  "description": "Reversibly hides the Google consumer apps, the Play Store and its auto-install hooks, the Google app with its hotword enrollers, and Google's account/partner extras, for a device that gets its apps from F-Droid. Play services, the framework, the keyboard, WebView, Contacts, Messages, Files and the accessibility services stay. Disable and reboot to restore.",
